{"story":{"id":"story-4547370394905cdb","title":{"zh":"扫描完毕","en":"Scan Complete"},"category":"society","image":"art/5ff4a6f2439fb8cd99e7.webp","start":"first_contact.1145","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的活动举办时间远超预期。\n\n乘坐太空梭返回后，[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]汇报了行动大获成功。不仅这种外星语言被大部分破解了，我们的扫描也揭示了他们科技能力的清晰图景。\n\n这将会极大地促进我们与[This.ContactCountry.GetName]未来的关系，同时还让他们对我们对他们科技了如指掌一事蒙在鼓里。","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName]'s event lasted much longer than expected.\n\nWhen [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName]'s shuttle returned, they reported that the operation was a success. Not only did they successfully decipher most of the alien language"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact.1145"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact.1145","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.1145","title":{"zh":"扫描完毕","en":"Scan Complete"},"texts":[{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的活动举办时间远超预期。\n\n乘坐太空梭返回后，[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]汇报了行动大获成功。不仅这种外星语言被大部分破解了，我们的扫描也揭示了他们科技能力的清晰图景。\n\n这将会极大地促进我们与[This.ContactCountry.GetName]未来的关系，同时还让他们对我们对他们科技了如指掌一事蒙在鼓里。","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName]'s event lasted much longer than expected.\n\nWhen [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName]'s shuttle returned, they reported that the operation was a success. Not only did they successfully decipher most of the alien language, but our scan has given us a clear picture of their technological capabilities.\n\nThis will greatly enhance further relations with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName], without them being aware of our understanding of their scientific knowledge."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/5ff4a6f2439fb8cd99e7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-03b48b046e84